@baseUrl = http://localhost:5223
@directorId = 1
@genreId = 1
@movieId = 1

### Create a director
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/directors
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Christopher","lastName":"Nolan","isRetired":false}

### Create a genre
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Science Fiction"}

### Create a movie (use the returned director ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Inception","releaseDate":"2010-07-16T00:00:00","totalRevenue":825500000,"directorId":{{directorId}}}

### Link the movie and genre
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movie-genres
Content-Type: application/json

{"movieId":{{movieId}},"genreId":{{genreId}}}

### Movie filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?name=inception&releaseYear=2010

### Director filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directors?lastName=nolan&isRetired=false

### Genre filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/genres?name=science

### Movies in a genre
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/genres/{{genreId}}/movies

### Movies by a director
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directors/{{directorId}}/movies

### Relationship filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movie-genres?movieId={{movieId}}&genreId={{genreId}}

### A referenced director cannot be deleted (409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/directors/{{directorId}}

### Delete a linked genre (movie survives)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/genres/{{genreId}}

### Delete the movie
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}

### The unreferenced director can now be deleted
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/directors/{{directorId}}
